description	"Tyria Sarkin Tainer

Force-sensitive Infiltrator Commando.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- Tracks/Cripples On Hit
- Venomous Vibroknife (Cyan Style Saber)
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense 
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- Poisons/Tracks
- DL-44 Wraith Pistol (3)
-- 20%+ Damage/FP Drain
-- 35%- RoF
-- 10%+ Velocity
-- Mag Reload
- A280 Infiltrator Rifle (3)
-- 25%+ RoF
-- 15%- Damage/FP Drain
-- 15%+ Velocity
-- Mag Reload
- Detpacks (3)
-- Ignites/Disarms/Tracks On Hit
- Concussion Grenade (1)

^5Powers:
- Sense (3)
- Pull (2)
- Push (1)

^3Inventory:
- Seeker Drone

^8Attributes:
- Spy Disguise (3)
- Seeing Stealth
- Knockdown Roll
- Bunny Hop (0)
- Dexterity (1)
- Grapple Hook (2)
- Grapple Hop
- Slow Faller
- Force Focus (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Melee Resist
- Blast Armor
- Anti-Mindtrick (1)
- Healing (1)
- Ammo (3)

^8Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS2]
- Tracking Darts (4) ^3[CS2 Melee]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4]"